{
  "info": {
    "name": "Devsu - Microservicios bancarios",
    "description": "Coleccion Postman del reto Devsu (F4-F9).\n\n**Flujo rapido Anexo A (Casos 1-5):**\n1. client-service > F4 - Caso 1 (3 POST clientes)\n2. Esperar ~5 s (sync Kafka -> cliente_referencia)\n3. account-service > F7 - Caso 2 (4 cuentas)\n4. account-service > F7 - Caso 3 (cuenta 585545)\n5. account-service > F8 - Caso 4 (4 movimientos)\n6. account-service > F9 - Caso 5 (GET reporte)\n\nRequisitos: Docker (postgres+kafka), client-service :8081, account-service :8082.\nVariables de entorno: Devsu-Local.postman_environment.json",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "clientBaseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:8081" },
    { "key": "accountBaseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:8082" },
    { "key": "joseClienteId", "value": "1" },
    { "key": "marianelaClienteId", "value": "2" },
    { "key": "juanClienteId", "value": "3" },
    { "key": "cuentaId", "value": "1" },
    { "key": "movimientoId", "value": "1" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "client-service",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Health",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{clientBaseUrl}}/api/health"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "F4 - Caso 1 - Crear clientes Anexo A",
          "description": "Tras ejecutar los 3 POST, esperar ~5 s antes de crear cuentas en account-service (Kafka + outbox).",
          "item": [
            {
              "name": "POST Jose Lema",
              "event": [
                {
                  "listen": "test",
                  "script": {
                    "exec": [
                      "const res = pm.response.json();",
                      "if (pm.response.code === 201 && res.success) {",
                      "  pm.collectionVariables.set('joseClienteId', res.data.id);",
                      "}"
                    ],
                    "type": "text/javascript"
                  }
                }
              ],
              "request": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [
                  { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
                  { "key": "X-Correlation-Id", "value": "{{$guid}}" }
                ],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"nombre\": \"Jose Lema\",\n  \"identificacion\": \"1234567890\",\n  \"direccion\": \"Otavalo sn y principal\",\n  \"telefono\": \"098254785\",\n  \"contrasena\": \"1234\",\n  \"estado\": true\n}"
                },
                "url": "{{clientBaseUrl}}/api/clientes"
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "POST Marianela Montalvo",
              "event": [
                {
                  "listen": "test",
                  "script": {
                    "exec": [
                      "const res = pm.response.json();",
                      "if (pm.response.code === 201 && res.success) {",
                      "  pm.collectionVariables.set('marianelaClienteId', res.data.id);",
                      "}"
                    ],
                    "type": "text/javascript"
                  }
                }
              ],
              "request": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [
                  { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
                  { "key": "X-Correlation-Id", "value": "{{$guid}}" }
                ],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"nombre\": \"Marianela Montalvo\",\n  \"identificacion\": \"0987654321\",\n  \"direccion\": \"Amazonas y NNUU\",\n  \"telefono\": \"097548965\",\n  \"contrasena\": \"5678\",\n  \"estado\": true\n}"
                },
                "url": "{{clientBaseUrl}}/api/clientes"
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "POST Juan Osorio",
              "event": [
                {
                  "listen": "test",
                  "script": {
                    "exec": [
                      "const res = pm.response.json();",
                      "if (pm.response.code === 201 && res.success) {",
                      "  pm.collectionVariables.set('juanClienteId', res.data.id);",
                      "}"
                    ],
                    "type": "text/javascript"
                  }
                }
              ],
              "request": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [
                  { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
                  { "key": "X-Correlation-Id", "value": "{{$guid}}" }
                ],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"nombre\": \"Juan Osorio\",\n  \"identificacion\": \"1122334455\",\n  \"direccion\": \"13 junio y Equinoccial\",\n  \"telefono\": \"098874587\",\n  \"contrasena\": \"1245\",\n  \"estado\": true\n}"
                },
                "url": "{{clientBaseUrl}}/api/clientes"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "GET listar clientes (paginado)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{clientBaseUrl}}/api/clientes?page=0&size=20",
              "host": ["{{clientBaseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "clientes"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "page", "value": "0" },
                { "key": "size", "value": "20" }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "GET cliente por id",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{clientBaseUrl}}/api/clientes/{{joseClienteId}}"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "PUT actualizar cliente",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"nombre\": \"Jose Lema\",\n  \"identificacion\": \"1234567890\",\n  \"direccion\": \"Otavalo sn y principal\",\n  \"telefono\": \"098254785\",\n  \"contrasena\": \"5678\",\n  \"estado\": true\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{clientBaseUrl}}/api/clientes/{{joseClienteId}}"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "DELETE baja logica cliente",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{clientBaseUrl}}/api/clientes/{{joseClienteId}}"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "account-service",
      "description": "F7 cuentas, F8 movimientos, F9 reportes. Requiere cliente_referencia sincronizada (Caso 1 + espera Kafka).",
      "item": [
